  ],
  "additional_assumptions": [
    "The 'stronger integral selector' removes self-duality/evenness/minimality inputs only within the specific class of standard D_(n+1)+A_(n-1) overlattices with primitive family charge, not universally.",
    "The function-differential typing result (dim=3) is a topological consequence of the genus-zero four-point divisor mu4 on P^1, independent of physical field identification.",
    "No new CAR master, free metric, Gaussianization, or universal clock requirement is assumed; existing conditional OS/CAR routes are reused as scoped consequences."
  ],
